@host = http://localhost:5000

### Ca 1: GET / -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/

### Ca 2: GET /api/assignments (danh sách bài tập) -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### Ca 3: POST /api/assignments/1/submissions (tạo lượt nộp hợp lệ) -> 201 Created
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### Ca 4: GET /api/submissions/{id} (đọc lại lượt nộp vừa tạo) -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Ca 5: POST /api/assignments/1/submissions (thiếu studentCode) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### Ca 6: POST /api/assignments/999/submissions (bài tập không tồn tại) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### Ca 7: GET /api/submissions/{id} (id không tồn tại) -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Ca 8: POST /hubs/submissions/negotiate (bắt tay SignalR) -> 200 OK
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### Ca 9: POST /hub/submissions/negotiate (sai đường dẫn hub thiếu chữ s) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
